[REQUIREMENT]
UID: AC-SSS005
TITLE: A lost link shall preserve the last accepted clearance
STATEMENT: >>>
When the link is down, the aircraft shall not originate a request, a readback, a repeat, or an emergency call. It shall keep the last clearance it had already accepted and shall continue that maneuver. A clearance offered while the link is down shall not become accepted. With no accepted taxi or takeoff clearance, the aircraft shall remain stopped on the ground. Acceptance is a taxi already in progress that continues after the link goes down, and a new request that adds no phrase.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Silence is not a new instruction.
<<<
DAL: E
